    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mystal Haven is a laid-back, open-world creature-collecting game with 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer with your Steam friends or random match-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you play with others or go solo, you'll collect cute creatures and explore new worlds. Your single-player saves work in multiplayer, so there's no need to start all over if you want to play online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Supports both local 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer with your Steam friends and random match-making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creature Collecting</strong>: As you explore, add new creatures to your vault and raise them into more powerful adult versions that grow slightly larger with each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creature Battles</strong>: Battle using traditional turn-based attacks or real-time overworld attacks. Play the way you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creature Interactions</strong>: Ride, feed, and even breed your creatures to produce rare hybrid types. You can also give them fun hats to wear.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mystal Haven is a laid-back, open-world creature-collecting game with 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer with your Steam friends or random match-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you play with others or go solo, you'll collect cute creatures and explore new worlds. Your single-player saves work in multiplayer, so there's no need to start all over if you want to play online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Supports both local 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer with your Steam friends and random match-making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creature Collecting</strong>: As you explore, add new creatures to your vault and raise them into more powerful adult versions that grow slightly larger with each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creature Battles</strong>: Battle using traditional turn-based attacks or real-time overworld attacks. Play the way you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creature Interactions</strong>: Ride, feed, and even breed your creatures to produce rare hybrid types. You can also give them fun hats to wear.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Mystal Haven is a laid-back, open-world creature-collector featuring four-player split-screen and online multiplayer.",
